w-rw----. 1 root aid_everybody 20606 Oct 18 13:49 21_SOURCE_TO_KNOWLEDGE_PIPELINE.md\r\n-rw-rw----. 1 root aid_everybody 21252 Oct 18 13:56 22_WRITING_AND_EVIDENCE_SYSTEM.md\r\n-rw-rw----. 1 root aid_everybody 38079 Oct 18 20:37 23_RETRIEVAL_QA_AND_HONEST_STATUS.md\r\n-rw-rw----. 1 root aid_everybody 52634 Oct 18 20:34 24_AGENT_HANDOFF_AND_RECOVERY.md\r\n-rw-rw----. 1 root aid_everybody 47360 Oct 18 20:56 25_CHANGE_CONTROL_AND_UPDATE_PROTOCOL.md\r\n-rw-rw----. 1 root aid_everybody   806 Oct  6 11:00 99_LESSONS_AND_FAILURES.md\r\n-rw-rw----. 1 root aid_everybody  9497 Oct 18 21:18 INDEX.md\r\n"}
